{
  "description": "Cases for the drawdown_entry cross-test. Each runs over drawdown_prices.csv. Unlisted rule fields take research/drawdown_entry.py's Params defaults, except recover_to_high, which is off unless listed. start is the first decision date; earlier bars are warmup.",
  "cases": [
